            "This example also shows why deterministic evidence is not synonymous with a shared interpretation. A monitoring record may establish that a facility was frozen or that a delivery did not occur. Parties may still disagree about the legal significance, reciprocal performance, or remedy. The purpose of a reliable record is to narrow factual disputes and support accountable decision-making, not to make political judgment disappear.",
